        "selector": {
          "type": "FragmentSelector",
          "value": "xywh=pixel:658.4334716796875,4235.1513671875,3937.3057861328125,1577.97705078125",
          "conformsTo": "http://www.w3.org/TR/media-frags/"
        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "verso",
          "value": "<p>I am writing with people standing over me because I have been told that the messenger who is to carry my reply is in a hurry. Longing makes me fly to you in spirit, and I sing:</p>\n<p>Love is my guarantor and not my feet.</p>\n<p>Peace to my master\u2014peace as great as my longing\u2014and God\u2019s mercy.</p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
